{
  "mn71:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 71 ",
  "mn71:0.2": "Tevijjavacchasutta ",
  "mn71:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn71:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā vesāliyaṁ viharati mahāvane kūṭāgārasālāyaṁ. ",
  "mn71:2.1": "Tena kho pana samayena vacchagotto paribbājako ekapuṇḍarīke paribbājakārāme paṭivasati. ",
  "mn71:3.1": "Atha kho bhagavā pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya vesāliṁ piṇḍāya pāvisi. ",
  "mn71:3.2": "Atha kho bhagavato etadahosi: ",
  "mn71:3.3": "“atippago kho tāva vesāliyaṁ piṇḍāya carituṁ; ",
  "mn71:3.4": "yannūnāhaṁ yena ekapuṇḍarīko paribbājakārāmo yena vacchagotto paribbājako tenupasaṅkameyyan”ti. ",
  "mn71:3.5": "Atha kho bhagavā yena ekapuṇḍarīko paribbājakārāmo yena vacchagotto paribbājako tenupasaṅkami. ",
  "mn71:4.1": "Addasā kho vacchagotto paribbājako bhagavantaṁ dūratova āgacchantaṁ. ",
  "mn71:4.2": "Disvāna bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn71:4.3": "“Etu kho, bhante, bhagavā. ",
  "mn71:4.4": "Svāgataṁ, bhante, bhagavato. ",
  "mn71:4.5": "Cirassaṁ kho, bhante, bhagavā imaṁ pariyāyamakāsi yadidaṁ idhāgamanāya. ",
  "mn71:4.6": "Nisīdatu, bhante, bhagavā idamāsanaṁ paññattan”ti. ",
  "mn71:4.7": "Nisīdi bhagavā paññatte āsane. ",
  "mn71:4.8": "Vacchagottopi kho paribbājako aññataraṁ nīcaṁ āsanaṁ gahetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. ",
  "mn71:4.9": "Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho vacchagotto paribbājako bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn71:5.1": "�